            </note>
            <note corresp="#d291-f2" n="23" xml:id="d291-f2-content">
                <p>Grigore Gafencu.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d291-f3" n="24" xml:id="d291-f3-content">
                <p>Friedrich Werner, Count von der Schulenburg.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d291-f4" n="25" xml:id="d291-f4-content">
                <p>Concerning Molotov’s visit to Berlin November 12–14, 1940, see <ref
                        target="frus1940v01#pg_573">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1940, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, pp. 573</ref>–<ref
                        target="frus1940v01#pg_582">582</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
